{
  "name": "dev-env-3-mycelium",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "Every module as one dependency tree (npm workspaces): each module a folder (pear-full-square/<module>), their dependencies resolved together, once. The dependencies here are what the applications composing them need: Bare's runtime (for the third-party package, so the node image needs no global install) and its aliases for Node's built-ins. The host side on Bare too: Bare's own modules (bare-fs, bare-subprocess, ...) and brittle for the tests, carried into the packages by the package writer.",
